---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13025550147';
const phoneDisplay = '(302) 555-0147';
---
<Layout title="Indoor Air Quality in Middletown, DE | AC Repair Middletown" description="Indoor air quality solutions in Middletown, DE. Filters, UV, humidity control.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Indoor Air Quality</h1>
      <p>Breathe Easier · Middletown &amp; New Castle County</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Better filtration, UV lights, and humidity control improve comfort and help your AC run more efficiently.</p>
      <h2>What We Provide</h2>
      <ul>
          <li>High-MERV and media filter upgrades</li>
          <li>UV germicidal lights</li>
          <li>Whole-home humidifiers and dehumidifiers</li>
          <li>Air purifiers and IAQ assessments</li>
          <li>Works with existing systems</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`} style="color:var(--primary);font-weight:600">{phoneDisplay}</a> for same-day service in Middletown, DE. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
